---
layout: base.njk
title: Pricing — Zennly
bodyClass: page--light-nav
---

<main>
  <div class="pricing-hero-wrap">
  <section class="section" id="pricing" style="padding-top: var(--space-2xl); padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl);">
    <div class="section__inner">

      <div class="pricing-wrap">

        <div class="pricing-left">
          <h2 class="section__h2">Pricing built around your business</h2>
          <p class="section__sub">No one-size-fits-all plans. Tell us about your branches, team size, and what you need — we'll put together a quote that fits.</p>
          <div class="pricing-signals">
            <div class="pricing-signal">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              No setup fees
            </div>
            <div class="pricing-signal">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              Full features during trial
            </div>
            <div class="pricing-signal">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              Works for any service vertical
            </div>
            <div class="pricing-signal">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              Setup in under a day
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pricing-right">
          <div class="pricing-card">
            <div class="pricing-card__eyebrow">Custom quote</div>
            <div class="pricing-card__headline">Let's talk about your setup</div>
            <p class="pricing-card__sub">Book a 30-minute demo. We'll understand your business, show you the platform, and send you a tailored quote within 24 hours.</p>
            <a href="/demo" class="btn-primary pricing-card__btn">Book a Demo</a>
            <div class="pricing-card__divider"></div>
            <p class="pricing-card__note">Already know what you need? <a href="mailto:info.zunkireelabs@gmail.com" class="pricing-card__link">Email us directly →</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
  </div>


  <!-- ── PRICING QUESTIONS ────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section" id="faq">
    <div class="section__inner">
      <div class="faq-header reveal">
        <h2 class="section__h2">A few honest answers before you book a call.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list" x-data="{ open: null }">
        <div class="faq-item reveal" data-delay="1" :class="{ 'faq-item--open': open === 0 }">
          <button class="faq-item__q" @click="open = open === 0 ? null : 0" :aria-expanded="open === 0">
            Why isn't there a fixed price list?
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__a" x-show="open === 0" x-cloak x-transition>
            <p>Because a one-branch salon and a four-branch spa chain don't use the same amount of platform. Rather than force you into a tier that's wrong in one direction or the other, we quote based on your branches, team size, and the features you actually need.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal" data-delay="2" :class="{ 'faq-item--open': open === 1 }">
          <button class="faq-item__q" @click="open = open === 1 ? null : 1" :aria-expanded="open === 1">
            What happens during the trial?
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__a" x-show="open === 1" x-cloak x-transition>
            <p>You get the full platform &ndash; booking, payments, discounts, staff management, reports &ndash; not a limited preview. We want you to see exactly how it runs your business before you commit to anything.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal" data-delay="3" :class="{ 'faq-item--open': open === 2 }">
          <button class="faq-item__q" @click="open = open === 2 ? null : 2" :aria-expanded="open === 2">
            How fast can we actually get a quote?
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__a" x-show="open === 2" x-cloak x-transition>
            <p>Book a 30-minute demo and we'll send a tailored quote within 24 hours. Most businesses are live on their first branch the same week.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal" data-delay="4" :class="{ 'faq-item--open': open === 3 }">
          <button class="faq-item__q" @click="open = open === 3 ? null : 3" :aria-expanded="open === 3">
            Does pricing change as we add branches?
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__a" x-show="open === 3" x-cloak x-transition>
            <p>Yes &ndash; your quote scales with your setup, not the other way around. When you open a new branch, we adjust the plan with you instead of pushing you into the next tier up.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ── BOTTOM CTA ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="bottom-cta" id="demo">
    <div class="bottom-cta__card bottom-cta__card--banner reveal">
      <h2 class="bottom-cta__h2">Let's put together a quote for your business.</h2>
      <p class="bottom-cta__sub">30 minutes, no obligation. We'll understand your setup and send a tailored quote within 24 hours.</p>
      <a href="/demo" class="bottom-cta__banner-btn">Book your demo &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── FOOTER ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  {% include "_footer-v2.njk" %}
</main>
